AArch64 MP+dmb.sy+swp-acq
"Reader uses an acquiring SWP on the flag: ordered"
{ 0:X1=x; 0:X3=y; 1:X1=y; 1:X3=x; }
 P0          | P1               ;
 MOV W0,#1   | MOV W5,#7        ;
 STR W0,[X1] | SWPA W5,W0,[X1]  ;
 DMB SY      | LDR W2,[X3]      ;
 MOV W2,#1   |                  ;
 STR W2,[X3] |                  ;
exists (1:X0=1 /\ 1:X2=0)
